{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Habit Tracker Widget 是一款專注於習慣養成的追蹤工具，讓你把每日習慣小工具直接放到主畫面或鎖定畫面，輕點一下即可完成打卡，無須開啟應用程式。無論你想建立晨間例行公事、養成運動或喝水習慣，還是想戒掉壞習慣，都可透過自訂顏色、標籤與樣式，打造貼合自己生活節奏的日常流程。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>桌面小工具一鍵打卡</h2>\n<p>應用支援在主畫面或鎖定畫面加入無限個習慣小工具，輕點小工具即可勾選當日習慣，並以連續達標計數與進度統計檢視整體表現。你可自訂顏色、標籤與風格，編排晨間例行清單或完整日常流程，甚至用來戒除壞習慣。內建每日清單同時協助整理待辦事項。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-39.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-41.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-42.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-44.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Habit Tracker Widget</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T16:58:00.211688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}